     ("A short-term capital loss can be set off against which gains?", "Both short-term and long-term capital gains", ["Only short-term gains", "Only long-term gains", "Salary income"], "A short-term capital loss can be set off against short-term and long-term gains, but not against salary or other heads."),
     ("After setting off the loss, what is her tax?", "₹28,125", ["₹34,375", "₹21,875", "₹40,625"], "Gain after set-off = 4,00,000 − 50,000 = 3,50,000. Less exemption 1,25,000 = 2,25,000. × 12.5% = ₹28,125."),
