     ("What is the position on the fixed deposit?", "Arun receives it as nominee, but all three legal heirs have a claim to it under succession law", ["Arun becomes the sole owner of the money", "The deposit is forfeited to the bank", "Lakshmi receives it alone because she is the widow"], "A nominee gets the money for safe discharge by the bank, but does not defeat the legal heirs' rights. Arun should share it with Lakshmi and Meera."),
